{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]Some people drink champagne out under the [Bb]stars
[Bb]While others drink [C7]wine lean over a [F]bar
[F]But all that I need dear to make me feel [Bb]fine
[Bb]Is to know that your [C7]love will forever be [F]mine
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]I'd give an Ocean of [Bb]Diamonds, the world filled with [F]flowers
Just to hold you [C7]close dear for just a few [F]hours
[F]To hear you whisper softly that you love me [Bb]too
Would change all the [C7]dark clouds to the bluest of [F]blue
{end_of_verse}

